  - key: doc.by_acknowledgment_of_this_instrument_the_traveller_accepts_a
    text: By acknowledgment of this instrument, the traveller accepts all temporal
      irregularities, local customs, and interval displacement arising from voluntary
      passage beyond the authorized present. No return interval is guaranteed.
    gloss: 0
    tier: 1
  - key: doc.the_traveller_assumes_responsibility_for_identity_drift_cale
    text: The traveller assumes responsibility for identity drift, calendar variance,
      memory desynchronization, and all ordinary consequences of remaining within
      a prior era. Claims against the Bureau shall not suspend the applicable century.
    gloss: 0
    tier: 1
  - key: doc.acceptance_confirms_that_the_traveller_has_received_notice_o
    text: Acceptance confirms that the traveller has received notice of the conditions
      of stranding and agrees to proceed without expectation of rescue, correction,
      or restoration. This waiver remains in force across all recognized continuities.
    gloss: 0
    tier: 1
